EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
       ffiinnddmmnntt ----ffssttaabb --tt nnffss
           Prints all NFS filesystems defined in _/_e_t_c_/_f_s_t_a_b.

       ffiinnddmmnntt ----ffssttaabb //mmnntt//ffoooo
           Prints all _/_e_t_c_/_f_s_t_a_b filesystems where the mountpoint directory is
           _/_m_n_t_/_f_o_o. It also prints bind mounts where _/_m_n_t_/_f_o_o is a source.

       ffiinnddmmnntt ----ffssttaabb ----ttaarrggeett //mmnntt//ffoooo
           Prints all _/_e_t_c_/_f_s_t_a_b filesystems where the mountpoint directory is
           _/_m_n_t_/_f_o_o.

       ffiinnddmmnntt ----ffssttaabb ----eevvaalluuaattee
           Prints all _/_e_t_c_/_f_s_t_a_b filesystems and converts LABEL= and UUID=
           tags to the real device names.

       ffiinnddmmnntt --nn ----rraaww ----eevvaalluuaattee ----oouuttppuutt==ttaarrggeett LLAABBEELL==//bboooott
           Prints only the mountpoint where the filesystem with label "/boot"
